{"answer_text":"Deal management has consolidated around a few strong products. The ones getting the most attention this year: [1]\n\n- **Pipewell**: Strong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest. [2]\n- **Tallyfox**: Drag-and-drop pipelines with weighted forecasts — lighter than enterprise tools, but enough for most B2B teams under 50 reps. [3]\n- **Northwind CRM**: Excellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin. [4]\n\nIn short, pick Pipewell for breadth, or Tallyfox if you want something your reps will adopt faster.\n\nLedgerline's 2026 roundup ranks most of these near the top as well.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50e2-700d-ac34-a54c0d3b0d30","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:33.450Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["top deal management apps 2026","deal management software reviews","best crm 2026 list"],"latency_ms":4200,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[119,127],[481,489]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[212,220],[506,514]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[358,371